2025-07-11 19:29:46 | INFO     | db.repositories.knowledge_repository:create_chunks:164 - 创建分块 10: 数据键 = ['id', 'document_id', 'content', 'chunk_index', 'chunk_metadata']
2025-07-11 19:29:46 | INFO     | db.repositories.knowledge_repository:create_chunks:165 - 创建分块 10: 数据 = {'id': '2dcb9d89-4759-4d50-bcf1-d26799dd2939', 'document_id': '308caa4d-0411-422e-b38c-baa8fb6a11c1', 'content': '1. This result was slightly higher than that of pure $\\mathrm{K}$ -geopolymer ${}^{25}$ , but it was less variable; the Weibull modulus was almost double, and the bamboo-reinforced geopolymer composite was semiductile, withholding stress for much larger strains after breaking. Table 1: Third-point loading flexural strength results and Weibull parameters. <table><tr><td>Sample</td><td>Modulus $m$ Shape</td><td>Scale ${\\sigma }_{0}$ (MPa)</td><td>${\\sigma }_{f\\text{-avg }}$ (MPa)</td><td>SD (MPa)</td><td>L95% (MPa)</td><td>U95% (MPa)</td></tr><tr><td>Pure K-geopolymer ${}^{25}$</td><td>2.700</td><td>5.10</td><td>4.50</td><td>1.80</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>Geopolymer-bamboo composite</td><td>5.104</td><td>5.04</td><td>4.63</td><td>1.04</td><td>3.96</td><td>5.41</td></tr></table>\n![01973e1a-dfe2-7052-97bf-a3fb626b5a97_7_192_232_911_601_0.jpg](images/01973e1a-dfe2-7052-97bf-a3fb626b5a97_7_192_232_911_601_0.jpg)\nFigure 6. Weibull plot for flexural strength data of bamboo-reinforced geopolymer composite.\nAn X-ray diffractogram for potassium-based, bamboo-reinforced, geopolymer composite is presented in Fig. 7. The XRD pattern shows the bamboo-reinforced geopolymer composite to be x-ray amorphous with a pronounced hump at ${28}^{ \\circ }{2\\Theta }$ , which confirmed geopolymer formation devoid of any crystalline phases at room temperature.\n![01973e1a-dfe2-7052-97bf-a3fb626b5a97_7_271_1044_756_450_0.jpg](images/01973e1a-dfe2-7052-97bf-a3fb626b5a97_7_271_1044_756_450_0.jpg)\nFigure 7. XRD pattern of bamboo-reinforced geopolymer composite.\n## CONCLUSIONS\nThis preliminary investigation reinforcing geopolymer composites with untreated bamboo fibers resulted in the following:', 'chunk_index': 10, 'chunk_metadata': {'strategy': 'semantic', 'type': 'ContentType.TEXT', 'headings': [], 'page_number': [1], 'extra': None}}
