2025-07-11 21:33:37 | INFO     | db.repositories.knowledge_repository:create_chunks:165 - 创建分块 0: 数据 = {'id': '48f605e4-3186-4860-abb4-ae9905941b11', 'document_id': '846eec7c-7c34-46ba-806b-aa960ee98a23', 'content': 'Polymer composites combine a polymer matrix with fillers. They are attractive in industrial applications and for academic research, due to control of the material properties. Natural rubber (NR) as a green and renewable polymer is widely used as a raw polymer material industrially, including in automotive parts and tires, because of its excellent mechanical and elastic properties. ${}^{\\left\\lbrack 1\\right\\rbrack }$ However, fillers are necessary in most cases to modify the NR properties for specific applications. A wide variety of particulate fillers are used in the rubber industry for multiple purposes, including reinforcement, reduced material costs, and improved processing. ${}^{\\left\\lbrack 2\\right\\rbrack }$ The most important fillers in rubber compounding are the conventional synthetic fillers based on carbon black and silica. They reinforce and enhance various properties such as tear strength, tensile strength, hardness, and abrasion resistance. ${}^{\\left\\lbrack 3\\right\\rbrack }$ The incorporation of solid particles with large specific surface, such as synthetic silica, quartz, carbonaceous materials, and metal oxides, provided ample filler surface to interact with the rubber molecules, and hence these are very effective in improving rubber properties. ${}^{\\left\\lbrack 4\\right\\rbrack }$ Synthetic silicas, for instance precipitated silica, possess siloxane and acidic silanol groups (Si-OH), ${}^{\\left\\lbrack 5\\right\\rbrack }$ and have also been widely used in the polymer industries. ${}^{\\left\\lbrack 6\\right\\rbrack }$ Typically the silica surfaces are hydrophilic, so they have strong tendency to adsorb moisture.', 'chunk_index': 0, 'chunk_metadata': {'strategy': 'semantic', 'type': 'ContentType.TEXT', 'headings': [], 'page_number': [1], 'extra': {'paragraph_index': 13, 'original_length': 2148}}}
