chemical compositions, but the geopolymer had more silicon dioxide $\\left( {\\mathrm{{SiO}}}_{2}\\right)$ . Also, some compounds were only found in GP, including phosphorus pentoxide, manganese oxide, barium oxide, sodium oxide, and zirconium oxide.', 'chunk_index': 11, 'chunk_metadata': {'strategy': 'semantic', 'type': 'ContentType.TEXT', 'headings': [], 'page_number': [1], 'extra': None}}
