on of geopolymers, and the reaction kinetics. That is, the movement of the main band allows monitoring the geopolymerization kinetics. ${}^{\\left\\lbrack {26}\\right\\rbrack }$ In Figure 4, two small bands at the wavenumbers 1,625 and $3,{452}{\\mathrm{\\;', 'chunk_index': 12, 'chunk_metadata': {'strategy': 'semantic', 'type': 'ContentType.TEXT', 'headings': [], 'page_number': [1], 'extra': None}}
