2025-07-11 21:33:37 | INFO     | db.repositories.knowledge_repository:create_chunks:165 - 创建分块 30: 数据 = {'id': '76999d30-1573-4d53-9260-f88a92cf9484', 'document_id': '846eec7c-7c34-46ba-806b-aa960ee98a23', 'content': 'relates to the Payne effect and filler-filler interactions in the composites. In addition, the thermal stability of GP-filled NR composites was slightly improved from that of the gum NR. Therefore, it is concluded that that ${10}\\mathrm{{phr}}$ of GP in NR composites might be suitable for some industrial applications. ## ACKNOWLEDGMENTS The authors would like to acknowledge financial support by the PSU NR-IRI (Natural Rubber Innovation Research Institute, contract no. SIT590315S. Also, Prince of Songkla University, Surat Thani Campus, Thailand, is gratefully acknowledged for providing access to its facilities.\n## ORCID\nCharoen Nakason http://orcid.org/0000-0003-1631-9369\n## REFERENCES\n[1] A. D. Roberts, Natural Rubber Science and Technology, Oxford University Press, New York 1988.\n[2] Y. Zhang, Q. Liu, Q. Zhang, Y. Lu, Appl. Clay Sci. 2010, 50, 255.\n[3] E. H. Andrews, Rubber Chem. Technol. 1963, 36, 325.\n[4] E. L. Warrick, O. R. Pierce, K. E. Polmanteer, J. C. Saam, Rubber Chem. Technol. 1979, 52, 437.\n[5] S. Wolff, Rubber Chem. Technol. 1982, 55, 967.\n[6] M. L. Hair, W. Hertl, J. Phys. Chem. 1970, 74, 91.\n[7] D. R. Bassett, E. A. Boucher, A. C. Zettlemoyer, J. Colloid Interface Sci. 1968, 27, 649.\n[8] E. H. Tan, S. Wolff, M. Haddeman, H. P. Grewatta, M. J. Wang, Rubber Chem. Technol. 1993, 66, 594.\n[9] S. Thongsang, N. Sombatsompop, J. Macromol. Sci. Part B 2007, 46,825.\n[10] N. Sombatsompop, S. Thongsang, T. Markpin, E. Wimolmala, J. Appl. Polym. Sci. 2004, 93, 2119.\n[11] W. Pongdong, C. Kummerlöwe, N. Vennemann, A. Thitithammawong, C. Nakason, Polym. Compos. 2016. https:// doi.org/10.1002/pc.23951\n[12] Z. X. Ooi, H. Ismail, A. A. Bakar, Polym. Test. 2014, 33, 145.\n[13] S. Kanking, P. Niltui, E. Wimolmala, N. Sombatsompop, Mater. Des. 2012, 41, 74.', 'chunk_index': 30, 'chunk_metadata': {'strategy': 'semantic', 'type': 'ContentType.TEXT', 'headings': [], 'page_number': [1], 'extra': None}}
