2025-07-11 21:46:10 | INFO     | db.repositories.knowledge_repository:create_chunks:176 - 创建分块 6: 数据 = {'id': '14b2e625-3375-4a0b-a3fd-08d98de5bc0d', 'document_id': '7ff3822c-812a-43ee-8698-1aa9534912ec', 'content': 'successfully reinforce the matrix in composite system. As a result, the compressive strength was the highest with such microstructure. However, even though the mullite crystal was found overa broader area in the case of ${60}\\mathrm{{wt}}\\%$ addition, but compressive strength in this condition was not as high as at ${40}\\mathrm{{wt}}\\%$ .  It could be because the ratio of solid to liquid has become too low, so the activator was insufficient to dissolve the raw materials, indicated by the presence of unreacted fly ash particles under SEM observation.', 'chunk_index': 6, 'chunk_metadata': {'strategy': 'semantic', 'type': 'ContentType.TEXT', 'headings': [], 'page_number': [1], 'extra': None}}
