2025-07-11 21:46:41 | INFO     | db.repositories.knowledge_repository:create_chunks:176 - 创建分块 9: 数据 = {'id': '94f0a05c-e475-4ce7-8639-bfb17f58c721', 'document_id': '8f0e4010-d70a-4f47-9129-b82d8760cbc2', 'content': 'failure, unlike pure geopolymers that failed suddenly without any warning. Hence, addition of bamboo fibers provided fracture toughness to the composite. ![01973e1a-dfe2-7052-97bf-a3fb626b5a97_5_155_547_990_374_0.jpg](images/01973e1a-dfe2-7052-97bf-a3fb626b5a97_5_155_547_990_374_0.jpg) Figure 3. SEM micrographs of bamboo-reinforced K-based geopolymer composite tested specimen, showing gaps and crack propagation in back scattered composite (BEC) mode, 230x and BEC mode, 150x. ![01973e1a-dfe2-7052-97bf-a3fb626b5a97_5_156_1029_988_373_0.jpg](images/01973e1a-dfe2-7052-97bf-a3fb626b5a97_5_156_1029_988_373_0.jpg) Figure 4. SEM micrographs of untreated Guadua BF, showing starch (small-round particles) in the parenchymal cells in secondary electron (SEI) and back scattered (BES) modes, 500x.\n![01973e1a-dfe2-7052-97bf-a3fb626b5a97_6_189_233_915_601_0.jpg](images/01973e1a-dfe2-7052-97bf-a3fb626b5a97_6_189_233_915_601_0.jpg)\nFigure 5. Stress-strain curves for bamboo-reinforced K-based geopolymer composite tested in four-point bending.\nThe Weibull probability plot (Fig. 6) of the flexural strength test data exhibited a straight line with a high coefficient of determination of 92.1%, which denotes that Weibull statistics can be used to analyze the data. The Weibull average value of the four-point flexural strength $\\left( {\\sigma }_{\\mathrm{f}}\\right)$ for the bamboo-reinforced geopolymer composite tested specimens was ${4.63}\\mathrm{{MPa}}$ , as shown in Table 1. This result was slightly higher than that of pure $\\mathrm{K}$ -geopolymer ${}^{25}$ , but it was less variable; the Weibull modulus was almost double, and the bamboo-reinforced geopolymer composite was semiductile, withholding stress for much larger strains after breaking.\nTable 1: Third-point loading flexural strength results and Weibull parameters.', 'chunk_index': 9, 'chunk_metadata': {'strategy': 'semantic', 'type': 'ContentType.TEXT', 'headings': [], 'page_number': [1], 'extra': None}}
