2025-07-11 22:04:05 | INFO     | db.repositories.knowledge_repository:create_chunks:176 - 创建分块 7: 数据 = {'id': '5c6a2d6c-3e97-46db-b3c8-67129f5898c8', 'document_id': 'd36b7122-2414-41cc-bb70-d36713287425', 'content': " These might be innovative and advantageous fillers in natural rubber composites. Therefore, the novel NR/GP composites which were prepared in this work had benefit over the conventional fillers in particular low energy-consuming process. <table><tr><td>Materials</td><td>Grades</td><td>Sources</td></tr><tr><td>Natural rubber (NR)</td><td>Air-dried sheet (ADS)</td><td>Nabon Rubber Co., Ltd. Nakhon Si Thammarat, Thailand</td></tr><tr><td>Zinc oxide</td><td>Commercial</td><td>Global Chemical Co., Ltd. Samut Prakan, Thailand</td></tr><tr><td>Stearic acid</td><td>Commercial</td><td>Imperial Industry Chemical Co., Ltd. Pathum Thani, Thailand</td></tr><tr><td>2,2'-Dithiobis-(benzothiazole) (MBTs)</td><td>Commercial</td><td>Flexsys, Termoli, Italy</td></tr><tr><td>Sulfur</td><td>Commercial</td><td>Ajax Chemical Co., Ltd. Samut Prakan, Thailand</td></tr><tr><td>Fly ash</td><td>By-product</td><td>Mae Moh power station, Lampang, Thailand</td></tr><tr><td>Sodium hydroxide</td><td>Analytical</td><td>Loba Chemie Pvt. Ltd. Mumbai, India</td></tr><tr><td>Sodium silicate solution</td><td>Commercial</td><td>Luoyang Qihang Chemical Industrial Co., Ltd, Luoyang, China</td></tr></table>\nTABLE 2 Formulations and mixing schedule for preparation of NR/geopolymer composites\n<table><tr><td>Ingredients</td><td>Quantities (phr)</td><td>Mixing time (min)</td></tr><tr><td>NR</td><td>100</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>ZnO</td><td>5</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>Stearic acid</td><td>1</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Geopolymer</td><td>0,10,20,30and 40</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>MBTs</td><td>0.5</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Sulfur</td><td>2.5</td><td>2</td></tr></table>\n### 2.2 | Preparation of geopolymers", 'chunk_index': 7, 'chunk_metadata': {'strategy': 'semantic', 'type': 'ContentType.TEXT', 