2025-07-11 22:04:05 | INFO     | db.repositories.knowledge_repository:create_chunks:176 - 创建分块 19: 数据 = {'id': '9b47433c-3ca7-4030-99b4-73cf293e17fd', 'document_id': 'd36b7122-2414-41cc-bb70-d36713287425', 'content': '3452</td><td>Stretching vibration of $- \\mathrm{{OH}}$ bonds</td><td>[25]</td></tr></table> TABLE 5 Assignments of the peaks of infrared spectra in Figure 3 ### 3.3 | Cure characteristics ![01974484-c8d5-72ac-a6d1-acf6a850ed04_5_910_484_728_608_0.jpg](images/01974484-c8d5-72ac-a6d1-acf6a850ed04_5_910_484_728_608_0.jpg) FIGURE 5 Cure curves for the gum and the geopolymer (GP)- or fly ash (FA)-filled natural rubber vulcanizates, with various GP loadings or 10 phr FA Table 6 summarizes the curing characteristics in terms of minimum, maximum, and delta torque, together with scorch and cure times for the gum NR, the NR/geopolymer, and the $\\mathrm{{NR}}/\\mathrm{{fly}}$ ash composites. It is noted that the minimum torque is proportional to the viscosity of the uncured compound, while the maximum torque is related to the extent of cross-linking and interactions in the rubber vulcanizate. It is clear that incorporation of geopolymer at ${10}\\mathrm{{phr}}$ increased the maximum torque and torque difference by filler-polymer and filler-filler interactions that reduced the mobility of the rubber chains. It is noted that filler-polymer (geopoly-mer-NR) and filler-filler (geopolymer-geopolymer) interactions are physical or chemical interactions. In Table 6, it is also seen that scorch and cure times became shorter with increasing geopolymer loading. This might be due to the metal oxides $\\left( {{\\mathrm{{Al}}}_{2}{\\mathrm{O}}_{3},{\\mathrm{{Fe}}}_{2}{\\mathrm{O}}_{3}}\\right.$ , and $\\mathrm{{MgO}}$ , see Table 4) as cure activators, accelerating the sulfur vulcanization of NR, ${}^{\\left\\lbrack {10}\\right\\rbrack }$ so that also the cure rate index increased with geopolymer loading. In addition, it is clearly seen that the cure rate index of the compound with ${10}\\mathrm{{phr}}\\mathrm{{GP}}$ was much lower than with 10 phr FA.\n![01974484-c8d5-72ac-a6d1-acf6a850ed04_6_127_126_1513_788_0.jpg](images/01974484-c8d5-72ac-a6d1-acf6a850ed04_6_127_126_1513_788_0.jpg)', 'chunk_index': 19, 'chunk_metadata': {'strategy': 'semantic', 'type': 'ContentType.TEXT', 'headings': [], 'page_number': [1], 'extra': None}}
