2025-07-11 22:04:05 | INFO     | db.repositories.knowledge_repository:create_chunks:176 - 创建分块 25: 数据 = {'id': '75d4d0b8-3318-4d0f-9125-80fad5924563', 'document_id': 'd36b7122-2414-41cc-bb70-d36713287425', 'content': 'the FA-filled NR composite had the lowest value. This implies that the filler-filler networks grew with geopolymer loading while the FA filler networks were weaker. It is noted that the network formation by a filler in NR matrix is strongly related to the specific surface area and the self-aggregation tendency.  That is, the FA with lower specific surface than the GP had less interfacial filler-filler interactions.', 'chunk_index': 25, 'chunk_metadata': {'strategy': 'semantic', 'type': 'ContentType.TEXT', 'headings': [], 'page_number': [1], 'extra': None}}
