2025-07-11 22:04:05 | INFO     | db.repositories.knowledge_repository:create_chunks:176 - 创建分块 26: 数据 = {'id': '28e46ada-5baf-4a25-b1ad-b3d2a012d421', 'document_id': 'd36b7122-2414-41cc-bb70-d36713287425', 'content': ' That is, the FA with lower specific surface than the GP had less interfacial filler-filler interactions. ![01974484-c8d5-72ac-a6d1-acf6a850ed04_9_124_124_1026_1593_0.jpg](images/01974484-c8d5-72ac-a6d1-acf6a850ed04_9_124_124_1026_1593_0.jpg)\nFIGURE 12 Thermogravimetric analysis and DTG thermograms of the gum and the filled natural rubber vulcanizates with 10 phr of fly ash or geopolymer\n### 3.6 | Dynamic properties\nTABLE 7 Decomposition temperature at different weight loss, residual mass at ${550}^{ \\circ }\\mathrm{C}$ and degradation temperature $\\left( {T}_{\\mathrm{d}}\\right)$ of gum, GP- and FA (10 phr)-filled NR vulcanizates\n<table><tr><td rowspan="2">Samples</td><td colspan="4">Decomposition temperature at different $\\%$ weight loss</td><td rowspan="2">Residual (%) mass at ${550}^{ \\circ }\\mathrm{C}$</td><td rowspan="2">Degradation temperature (℃)</td></tr><tr><td>${\\mathbf{T}}_{5\\% }$</td><td>${T}_{{10}\\% }$</td><td>${T}_{{50}\\% }$</td><td>${T}_{{80}\\% }$</td></tr><tr><td>Gum NR</td><td>334.3</td><td>349.8</td><td>385.3</td><td>423.6</td><td>5.9</td><td>375.7</td></tr><tr><td>NR-GP10</td><td>342.8</td><td>352.5</td><td>386.1</td><td>440.2</td><td>16.7</td><td>376.5</td></tr><tr><td>NR-FA10</td><td>339.9</td><td>351.9</td><td>387.6</td><td>436.7</td><td>14.3</td><td>372.8</td></tr></table>\n### 3.7 | Thermal properties', 'chunk_index': 26, 'chunk_metadata': {'strategy': 'semantic', 'type': 'ContentType.TEXT', 'headings': [], 'page_number': [1], 'extra': None}}
